  chain  ["Index funds and the interest rate" "Index funds and the interest rate" "Saving money on a mortgage loan"]
  chain  ["Index funds and the interest rate" "Index funds and the interest rate" "The bank raised the savings rate"]
  chain  ["Index funds and the interest rate" "Saving money on a mortgage loan"]
  chain  ["Index funds and the interest rate" "The bank raised the savings rate"]

── what to take away ──
  Retrieval as a TRAVERSAL: seed by meaning, hop through citations,
  carry the path. The answer returns evidence AND its justification —
  the provenance a RAG citation needs. Mixing a computed relation with
  a bl function (conj) runs on the bl fixpoint: the honest boundary.

