── what to take away ──
  Plain RAG = embed question, retrieve nearest passages, prompt an LLM
  It excels at LOCAL questions answerable from a few passages
  It FAILS at GLOBAL questions whose answer spans the whole corpus
  The fix is a GRAPH + community summaries — the next three files

